{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WILDERLOCKE</strong> takes the high stakes tactical battles of monster-taming JRPG challenges like the <strong>Nuzlocke</strong> and adds the unpredictability and <strong>replayability of the roguelike formula</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/03b694ddbb29934614370b69eb875866.avif?t=1766095545\" width=1560 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/c4ef6c1b7569743476ea103907638b88.gif?t=1766095545\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/c4ef6c1b7569743476ea103907638b88.poster.avif?t=1766095545\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ monsters</strong> to discover and evolve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>250+ varied moves</strong>, <strong>80+ versatile passives</strong> (and more to come).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A customisable set of <strong>4 moves</strong> and <strong>2 passives</strong> for each monster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Half of your monster\u2019s stats</strong> depend on its species, <strong>the others are set by you</strong> - build the same monster as a supporting tank or fast damage dealer, depending on what your party needs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/17e18f50d7990720ce19678cdd9fb0d1.avif?t=1766095545\" width=1560 height=307 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/4184ee7a1faa9d8776e02f41558d6c86.poster.avif?t=1766095545\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/4184ee7a1faa9d8776e02f41558d6c86.webm?t=1766095545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/4184ee7a1faa9d8776e02f41558d6c86.mp4?t=1766095545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fresh take on <strong>the iconic JRPG battle system</strong>, with a focus on 2v2 mechanics, building synergies and versatile abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat your opponents with <strong>a variety of strategies</strong> - protect and strenghten one monster, apply crippling status effects, stall and do damage over time, or simply hit harder and faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to <strong>field conditions</strong> like the weather, or set them yourself to advantage your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No randomness</strong> in battle (no critical hits, chances to miss, or moves with random secondary effects).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Errors are costly</strong> - lose a monster during a battle and it\u2019s lost forever - lose all of them and your run is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/e03d139281acf54274b0c5cc919c5fa5.avif?t=1766095545\" width=1560 height=215 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/4463ccfe8d3e9716220b770eb9457e46.poster.avif?t=1766095545\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/4463ccfe8d3e9716220b770eb9457e46.webm?t=1766095545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/4463ccfe8d3e9716220b770eb9457e46.mp4?t=1766095545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>unique combination </strong>of opponents, encounters &amp; monsters each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12+ different bosses</strong> with <strong>48+ handpicked parties</strong> &amp; unique <strong>battle modifiers</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win runs with your favourite monsters to <strong>unlock them as starters</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+ levels of increasing difficulty</strong>, to challenge even the most experienced monster trainers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>free Demo</strong> of the game will be coming soon. <strong>Add WILDERLOCKE to your wishlists</strong> to be notified of its release !</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3512280?t=1766095545","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3512280?t=1766095545","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/3204cf5942e4bb70ecfbd120cf5dd78162823478/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766095545","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/3204cf5942e4bb70ecfbd120cf5dd78162823478/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766095545","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WILDERLOCKE</strong> takes the high stakes tactical battles of monster-taming JRPG challenges like the <strong>Nuzlocke</strong> and adds the unpredictability and <strong>replayability of the roguelike formula</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/03b694ddbb29934614370b69eb875866.avif?t=1766095545\" width=1560 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/c4ef6c1b7569743476ea103907638b88.gif?t=1766095545\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/c4ef6c1b7569743476ea103907638b88.poster.avif?t=1766095545\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ monsters</strong> to discover and evolve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>250+ varied moves</strong>, <strong>80+ versatile passives</strong> (and more to come).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A customisable set of <strong>4 moves</strong> and <strong>2 passives</strong> for each monster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Half of your monster\u2019s stats</strong> depend on its species, <strong>the others are set by you</strong> - build the same monster as a supporting tank or fast damage dealer, depending on what your party needs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/17e18f50d7990720ce19678cdd9fb0d1.avif?t=1766095545\" width=1560 height=307 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/4184ee7a1faa