team/apps/3512280/extras/4463ccfe8d3e9716220b770eb9457e46.webm?t=1766095545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/extras/4463ccfe8d3e9716220b770eb9457e46.mp4?t=1766095545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>unique combination </strong>of opponents, encounters &amp; monsters each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12+ different bosses</strong> with <strong>48+ handpicked parties</strong> &amp; unique <strong>battle modifiers</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win runs with your favourite monsters to <strong>unlock them as starters</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+ levels of increasing difficulty</strong>, to challenge even the most experienced monster trainers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>free Demo</strong> of the game will be coming soon. <strong>Add WILDERLOCKE to your wishlists</strong> to be notified of its release !</p>","developers":["David Litt"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512280/72fb46cb8fd0c3f1e4d5b45370fac1516f185486/header.jpg?t=1766095545","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3512280/674478624/3475e6a89873ac3d845bdb8f50c5984452f06869/1750857167/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747000600","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3512280/674478624/3475e6a89873ac3d845bdb8f50c5984452f06869/1750857167/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747000600","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3512280/674478624/3475e6a89873ac3d845bdb8f50c5984452f06869/1750857167/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747000600","id":257138200,"name":"WILDERLOCKE : A Nuzlocke Inspire